                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 tracking-wide uppercase">Introducing VyaparPe 2.0</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-[3.5rem] md:text-[5rem] lg:text-[6.5rem] font-extrabold text-black mb-6 drop-shadow-sm fade-in-up" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                The operating system<br>
                for <span class="gradient-text-accent">commerce.</span>
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-500 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium fade-in-up" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
